Revision history for Alien-Build-Plugin-Download-GitLab (cleaned edition)

0.03  2026-10-20
        - Send PRIVATE-TOKEN to every request on the configured GitLab
          host, not only the exact releases URL, so private source
          archives authenticate. Never send the token to another host
          or scheme.
        - Redact the token from log lines and from API error exceptions.
        - Request per_page=100, order_by=released_at, sort=desc.
        - Reject GitLab error objects instead of iterating a hash.
        - Do not autovivify a missing assets hash.
        - Ignore empty tokens.
        - Require this edition (0.03) at configure time.

0.02  2026-10-20
        - First cleaned copy from the local GitLab.pm
        - Fixed `my $filename =>` syntax error
        - Added private token support for the releases index only
        - Token redaction in logs
        - Defensive handling of missing assets arrays
        - Based on original 0.01 by Graham Ollis

0.01  (upstream)
        - Original release by Graham Ollis
